            "authorType": "COMMENT",
            "competitionRanking": 1092,
            "content": "<p>Hi <a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/cpmpml\" target=\"_blank\">@cpmpml</a> ,</p>\n<p>Thanks for the reply! When you mention that notebooks must be shared \"prior to the mid point deadline,\" could you clarify exactly how that interacts with the April 9th and April 16th dates?</p>\n<p>Specifically, I want to clarify the deadline to hit the 'publish' button:\nDoes the highest-scoring notebook need to be made public before April 9th (the leaderboard cut-off) to be eligible? Or, is it acceptable to get the highest score by April 9th, and then make that winning notebook public by April 16th (the methodology cut-off)?</p>",
            "feedbackTrackingData": {},
