                "content": "<blockquote>\n  <p>Notebook should be shared publicly by end of day April 9.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>While I understand that you are a competition host, I have been interpreting rule to be that the notebook needs to be shared before April 16th.</p>\n<p>Is there a precedent (prior Kaggle competition) for having the leaderboard submission and notebook sharing to be the same day? How did they prevent people from simply forking, submitting and sharing the notebook?</p>\n<p>If we interpret April 9th is also the notebook sharing deadline, how do we interpret what April 16th is for?</p>",
